---
<BaseLayout title="About — The Starkonium Times" description="About Medha Sharma, student and computational biology researcher."><Container as="section" class="page"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Medha Sharma</h1><p>I'm an undergraduate at BITS Pilani, K. K. Birla Goa Campus, pursuing a dual degree in Biological Sciences and Mathematics and Computing.</p><p>My research interests span molecular simulation, computational biophysics, quantitative image analysis, and methods for making scientific measurements and inferences more reproducible.</p><p>I held a Biochemical Society Summer Vacation Studentship at the University of Cambridge in 2026. This website collects selected research projects and writing in one place.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/daughterofstark">GitHub</a> · <a href="/projects">Research</a> · <a href="/writing">Writing</a></p></Container></BaseLayout><style>.page{padding-block:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);min-height:55vh}h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem)}p{max-width:70ch;line-height:1.8;margin-block:1.5rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--orange);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}</style>
